WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.560
The invoice board keeps the routing result beside the document values.

2
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.320
The synthetic invoice shows Posted on the demo route with clear checks.

3
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.920
The claim board also keeps its routing result in view.

4
00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:23.320
The supplier board holds fictional suppliers imported through the visible Import control.

5
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.960
Open purchase orders provide the supplier and amount for invoice checks.

6
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.300
The policy board supplies the reference data for claim checks.

7
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:38.340
The imported workflow templates are published and enabled in FlowOps, iMBrace's workflow builder.

8
00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:44.340
Creating an invoice record starts its check-and-route workflow.

9
00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:49.940
The claim board uses its own record-created trigger for the check workflow.

10
00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:56.180
The decisions board is linked to the separate decision workflow.

11
00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:02.340
The synthetic invoice's extracted values are available in DocIQ for confirmation.

12
00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:07.100
The invoice board shows a successful check and simulated posting.

13
00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:13.300
The demo finance outbox holds the invoice posting and its purchase-order reference.
